8. Load origin payload onto origin node (makes origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed false, cargo unavailable).

9. Activate destination node (makes destination_node_ready true).

10. Lock destination availability (sets destination_availability_locked true, destination_availability_confirmed true). (Note: after lock, destination_node_ready remains true as precondition required.)

